. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HggWipXjqusQ7kNvwF9tdMM&_nc_oc=AdpbeydRVIl92c1WWPgHz1xkINxBIunWmSgSxDFRmRIAdE-4h4IpAKAwpTZjd0HE6X8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1lgLvcMqUAOS-0GpUXbk_sRK2Ldwo-Acz3yucK9VYahw&oe=69D7A33E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yNU-FmSTgG4Q7kNvwEjWGB1&_nc_oc=AdopP38NBKcaDYQ3Jq_YjN4UDkaNe_FaD9Imwdw_HKczh6LuhpPw0ZQMDYO8vKIRTIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2CLCxbx_3zVX4u5qSgTNsG8uAfcji95hAOClMSTpqVQA&oe=69D7B9DE"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZSJ7pCO3uuAQ7kNvwF4xCQR&_nc_oc=AdqcB8NK6pmf7wHj36nW8TWFl3XXmWh6R5a3u0g7EvAZ5zT5lC_Ex4jWk9G-04YNiug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3JDFXXwHGzBYXhfpMvHKTO23xG07g7GjvRMFih4h-NAw&oe=69D7AF5B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco